OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow      
OL,5,CToday:FMorning fog slow to clear but   
OL,6,Fonce it does, a fine chilly day        
OL,7,Ffollows with long sunny spells for     
OL,8,Fmost. Cloudier in Northern Ireland and 
OL,9,Fsouthwest England where occasionally   
OL,10,Fheavy rain and strong winds will push  
OL,11,Fin by afternoon.                       
OL,13,CTonight:FA band of heavy rain pushes   
OL,14,Fin from the west overnight, reaching   
OL,15,FWales and western areas of England and 
OL,16,FScotland by dawn. Dry and chilly       
OL,17,Ffurther east with clear spells.        
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
