OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow      
OL,5,CTuesday:FA cloudy but dry day away     
OL,6,Ffrom the band of rain which stalls in  
OL,7,Fa line from southwest England to       
OL,8,Fwestern Scotland. Remaining chilly for 
OL,9,Fmost with a noticeable breeze.         
